{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0d674c414e77b7de3d6ae3e958cc23d18f8f0c595d63e6e1faa2fe68b111f2d4", "ja": "（やっと外回りの営業が終わった。\n今日もたくさん歩いて、疲れたな）", "zh": "（总算跑完业务了。\n今天也走了好多路，真累人。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "a7fa71ba4bd3a85f0e0af957d7f2b08dd8669f4d599f3b7bf7b87a8f6caf5f5e", "ja": "お帰りなさい、{$P$}さん。\nお疲れさまでした～。", "zh": "你回来啦，{$P$}先生。\n工作辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1002_p", "source_sha256": "63bf6b637c19cba8f767b61bbab067375876f6c538621d0585c093471aaefcae", "ja": "ただいま、美也。\nこんなところで何をしてるんだ？", "zh": "我回来了，美也。\n你在这里做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "7c4e9db7b39bdae4da8c7b5afc981f1841741bce1a3b863d43e29a31bdae3b34", "ja": "はい～。{$P$}さんが、\n近ごろ、なんだかお疲れのようなので～。", "zh": "这个嘛～因为我觉得{$P$}先生\n最近好像都很累～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "ffcb02b4b7dc762f90bd3edf9e8043e83b16800957711759e4bac0d892fa8f60", "ja": "このお部屋に、ハンモックを\n取り付けようとしていました～。", "zh": "所以我想在这房间\n挂一张吊床～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "9d6b3f138e805d278db3e5306c57326fc418c255966991da914172ad59671a8d", "ja": "そうすれば、いつでもゆ～らゆら、\n気持ちよくお昼寝ができますよ～。", "zh": "这样的话，随时都可以摇摇晃晃～\n舒服地睡午觉啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9b892537de5aa1090d11017ac858b88fe17391465dd4a773a5dbb042c1ba628d", "ja": "ハンモックか……気持ち良さそうだけど、\n劇場の事務室に置くのは、ちょっと難しいかもな。", "zh": "吊床是吗……听起来是很舒服，\n不过剧场事务室的空间可能不够。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "2f15a5b3be6adc1e2649e50cbe08dc781b9622c6f110c2f6d74ba2a7fb83ec69", "ja": "そうですか～。それは残念です～。", "zh": "这样子啊～真可惜～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "d44c64214b100957fe4525a5856211c69c19db936aa6fc33f4358a49f9190382", "ja": "あっ、なら、屋上はどうでしょう～？\n外だし、気持ちいいかもしれませんね～。", "zh": "啊，那放在屋顶如何～？\n在室外应该会很舒服喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6d0dadcfea6d8f7fda564db19db13507b86ea909c2112260502f3a451df22a10", "ja": "屋上？　いや、屋上だと吊るすところが……\nあっ、待ってくれ美也！", "zh": "屋顶？不，屋顶又没地方挂……\n啊，等等，美也！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "5d4c701123b1b6ac9a2f30579ddf8e49657267bd7e17c73732bb67e4f09daae6", "ja": "む～ん……\nなかなか、いい場所がありませんね～。", "zh": "嗯……\n找不到合适的地方呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1011_p", "source_sha256": "5aaca0ce20ec3ce3f7c405b8cdb9ff9352832c78abfa6effc7b35b53b68b5ca0", "ja": "美也、どこまで行くんだ？", "zh": "美也，你要去哪里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "fb7a29fc1effd7346adc22a67085157811e5eca05c9ed94130c525871bc2fc58", "ja": "あっ……そうだ、{$P$}さん。\n公園なら、ちょうどいい木がありそうですよ～？", "zh": "啊……对了，{$P$}先生。\n公园的树木应该很适合挂吊床吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "12775d81846b3a2d4083ba394f5a913ba7400685ab45c9c424de2b213c6c4914", "ja": "さっそく、探しに行きましょう～。", "zh": "我们快去找找吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0230aeccced7f8ff0577b81fb9656cd50effc12b1af5167082751317e58d91a5", "ja": "どこに行くんだ美也……！", "zh": "你到底要去哪里，美也……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1015_p", "source_sha256": "89da8fcd433d7db672754bf82bfa26d326984b7cf9ff53de1e7f490c86ce352d", "ja": "（あれから美也とハンモックに最適な場所を探して、\nこんなところまで来てしまった……ここはどこだ？）", "zh": "（之后我就和美也一起寻找挂吊床的最佳地点，\n跑来了这种地方……话说这是哪里啊？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "0dab25fc8054801acfbcfd68b6c1248ba437b455e196eda276de1aaf599736b0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、あの木の上は\nどうでしょう～。きっと気持ちいいですよ～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，挂在那棵树上如何～？\n一定很舒服～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "87669fe114e8bf45e7531d3ba68a49c40a50ddc266546ebd17f54c51de38320e", "ja": "毎日通うのは、ちょっと大変かもしれませんけど。\nいい運動になりそうですね～。", "zh": "虽然每天都要特地跑来这边，可能会有点辛苦。\n不过趁机运动一下也不错呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0053_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9b94ca42c4213bec6416fa8fd0daa096bf2bcc47dca267ac9321794fd708d3f6", "ja": "（緑の中の散歩は、結果的にいい気晴らしになった……\n美也の優しい気遣いに、感謝だな）", "zh": "（结果在一片绿意中散步，我的身心也放松不少……\n这都要感谢美也的体贴呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
